# Full-Stack Implementation Plan for handii.co

Upgrade the static `handii-react` store into a full-stack, craft-aesthetic e-commerce platform with a dynamic Admin CMS, User Authentication, Order Processing, and an interactive 3D Keychain Bag customizer—while **100% preserving the handcrafted paper-and-thread aesthetic**.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - The implementation is divided into 6 sequential phases as outlined below and in [IMPLEMENTATION_ROADMAP.md](file:///d:/handii-react/handii-react/IMPLEMENTATION_ROADMAP.md).
> - Backend will run on Node.js + Express alongside Vite frontend with SQLite/MongoDB database and Multer image uploads.
> - The handcrafted visual design system (`--cream`, `--paper`, `--ink`, `--gold`, `--rose`, `Fraunces`, `Caveat`) will be strictly preserved across all new admin portals, auth modals, and 3D scenes.

## Proposed Implementation Order

### Phase 1: Backend Server, Database Schema & Catalog Seeding
- Setup Express server with CORS, JSON body parser, and Multer file storage in `server/`.
- Create database schemas: `User`, `Product`, `Order`, `Reel`, `Content`.
- Migration script to seed ~138 products from `products.js` into the database.
- REST API routes: `/api/products`, `/api/reels`, `/api/upload`.

### Phase 2: User & Admin Authentication
- JWT auth endpoints: `register`, `login`, `me`, `address`.
- Frontend `AuthContext.jsx` with token persistence.
- Friendly, dismissible landing welcome popup + mandatory checkout auth gate.
- "My Orders" (`🧾`) access in header.

### Phase 3: Admin Dashboard & Dynamic CMS (`/admin`)
- Secure admin login and route guard.
- Analytics & KPI overview: Total Revenue, Pending Orders, Completed Orders, Low Stock.
- Order Manager: Filter orders, view customer info/swatches, update statuses, direct WhatsApp button.
- Product CRUD: Add/edit items, color swatch builder, drag-and-drop image uploader.
- Instagram Reels Manager: Dynamic URL and thumbnail updater without touching code.

### Phase 4: Cart Checkout & Live Order Tracking
- Multi-step checkout drawer: Bag Review ➔ Identity ➔ Delivery Address ➔ Payment/WhatsApp.
- Customer "My Orders" tracking stepper: `Received` ➔ `Coiling 🧵` ➔ `Resin Curing ✨` ➔ `Dispatched 🚚` ➔ `Delivered 🌸`.

### Phase 5: Interactive 3D Bag Customizer (Three.js)
- Three.js / `@react-three/fiber` 3D Canvas with Tote/Canvas Bag model and orbit controls.
- Interactive charm rack: snap catalog keychains onto bag straps with sway physics.
- Color variations and "Add Styled Bag & Charms to Cart".

### Phase 6: Value-Add Features, Custom Bouquet Builder & Polish
- Interactive Bouquet Builder: assemble custom flower stems, wrapping paper, and ribbons.
- Customer photo reviews ("Wall of Love").
- Cross-device responsive QA and context synchronization in [CODEBASE_CONTEXT.md](file:///d:/handii-react/handii-react/CODEBASE_CONTEXT.md).

